('111.4.b.9.D',3,'A ruler is marked in inches. The end of a crayon is between the 4 and 5 marks, but closer to the 4 mark. To the nearest inch, how long is the crayon?','["5 inches", "6 inches", "3 inches", "4 inches"]'::jsonb,3,'The end is closest to the 4 mark, so the length is about 4 inches.','original'),
('111.4.b.9.D',3,'A ruler is marked in inches. The end of a straw is between the 3 and 4 marks, but closer to the 4 mark. To the nearest inch, how long is the straw?','["4 inches", "3 inches", "5 inches", "2 inches"]'::jsonb,0,'The end is closest to the 4 mark, so the length is about 4 inches.','original'),
('111.4.b.9.E',2,'A rope is 38 inches long. A second rope is 27 inches long. How much longer is the first rope?','["65 inches", "11 inches", "9 inches", "13 inches"]'::jsonb,1,'38 − 27 = 11.','original'),
