('111.4.b.9.F',2,'A rectangle is covered with 6 rows of 2 square tiles. There are no gaps or overlaps. What is the area of the rectangle?','["8 square units", "14 square units", "12 square units", "6 square units"]'::jsonb,2,'6 rows of 2 is 6 × 2 = 12 square units.','original'),
('111.4.b.9.F',2,'A rectangle is covered with 6 rows of 7 square tiles. There are no gaps or overlaps. What is the area of the rectangle?','["49 square units", "13 square units", "36 square units", "42 square units"]'::jsonb,3,'6 rows of 7 is 6 × 7 = 42 square units.','original'),
