('111.4.b.9.G',3,'The hour hand is between the 11 and the 12. The minute hand points to the 8. What time does the clock show?','["8:55", "11:40", "11:45", "12:40"]'::jsonb,1,'The minute hand on the 8 means 40 minutes after the hour, so the time is 11:40.','original'),
('111.4.b.9.G',3,'The hour hand is between the 2 and the 3. The minute hand points to the 11. What time does the clock show?','["2:00", "2:50", "2:55", "11:10"]'::jsonb,2,'The minute hand on the 11 means 55 minutes after the hour, so the time is 2:55.','original'),
