('111.4.b.3.D',2,'A pizza is cut into 8 parts, but the parts are not the same size. Are the parts eighths?','["Yes, because there are 8 parts.", "No, because eighths are too small.", "No, because the parts are not equal.", "Yes, because it is a pizza."]'::jsonb,2,'Eighths must be 8 EQUAL parts.','original'),
